# Release test scenarios: hand-wrapped prose, tables, and frontmatter read by a
# deliberately non-YAML parser (scripts/surface/scenarios/load.mjs). Reflowing
# them would churn the diffs that make the suites reviewable, which is the whole
# reason they moved out of Notion.
#
# ROOT-ANCHORED on purpose. A bare `scenarios/` is a gitignore-style pattern that
# matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently swallowed
# `scripts/surface/scenarios/*.mjs` — the tooling that reads these files — so its
# own formatting stopped being checked. Keep the leading slash.
/scenarios/
